:: Trajet [date]
<p class="image">[Image of: you in your best outfit, which is also your only outfit]</p>
<p>It's D-Day. Your date starts in 10 minutes.</p>
<p>How do you get there?</p>
<div class="choix">
	<<if $lieu is "Restaurant">>
		[[🏃 Run|Resto_1_Arrivee][$arrivee to "course"]]
		[[🚌 Take the bus|Resto_1_Arrivee][$arrivee to "bus"]]
	<<else>>
		[[🏃 Run|Parc_1_Arrivee][$arrivee to "course"]]
		[[🚌 Take the bus|Parc_1_Arrivee][$arrivee to "bus"]]
	<</if>>
	[[🏛️ Cut through the main square. It's faster.|Fin_Ecrase]]
</div>
